() Tj T*
([1]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Ayushman Bharat   Pradhan Mantri Jan Arogya Yojana \(PM-JAY\)) Tj T*
(ID: pm-jay) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://nha.gov.in/img/resources/Adhikar-Patra.pdf) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: National Health Authority, PM-JAY beneficiary information and eligibility guidance) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Cashless health cover for eligible families for secondary and tertiary) Tj T*
(  hospitalization at empanelled hospitals.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Families identified under applicable national eligibility criteria and State/UT) Tj T*
(  expansions; beneficiary eligibility should be checked individually.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['National household eligibility is based on specified deprivation and occupational) Tj T*
(  criteria; States/UTs may expand or adapt coverage.', 'The scheme is not a general) Tj T*
(  open-enrolment health-insurance application. Check the official beneficiary database) Tj T*
(  or State Health Agency.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Health cover up to  5 lakh per eligible family per year for covered) Tj T*
(hospitalization at empanelled hospitals, subject to package and scheme rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Check eligibility through the official PM-JAY beneficiary portal, an authorized) Tj T*
(  Common Service Centre or an Ayushman Mitra at an empanelled hospital.', 'Eligible) Tj T*
(  beneficiaries follow the prescribed e-card and hospital verification process.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([2]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Pradhan Mantri Awas Yojana   Urban 2.0 \(PMAY-U 2.0\)) Tj T*
(ID: pmay-urban-2) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://pmay-urban.gov.in/uploads/guidelines/Operational-Guidelines-of-PMAY-U-2.pdf) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs, PMAY-U 2.0 operational guidelines) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Central assistance to eligible urban families to construct, purchase or rent an) Tj T*
(  affordable home through scheme components.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Eligible EWS, LIG and MIG families living in urban areas, subject to the selected) Tj T*
