(  component and State/UT validation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The family should not own a pucca house anywhere in India and should not have) Tj T*
(  received a home under a government housing scheme within the specified prior) Tj T*
(  period.', 'The published annual income bands are up to  3 lakh for EWS,  3 6 lakh for) Tj T*
(  LIG and  6 9 lakh for MIG; States/UTs may redefine EWS limits with Ministry) Tj T*
(  concurrence. Other component rules apply.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - Assistance through Beneficiary-Led Construction, Affordable Housing in) Tj T*
(Partnership, Affordable Rental Housing or Interest Subsidy components. Amounts and) Tj T*
(terms vary by component, State/UT and lending institution.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Register through the official PMAY-U 2.0 portal or contact the Urban Local) Tj T*
(  Body/State nodal agency.', 'The State/UT/ULB validates eligibility; loan-linked) Tj T*
(  assistance also requires lender processing.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([3]) Tj T*
(SCHEME: Atal Pension Yojana \(APY\)) Tj T*
(ID: atal-pension-yojana) Tj T*
(Official Portal: https://jansuraksha.gov.in/Files/APY/English/FAQ.pdf) Tj T*
(Last Verified: 2026-11-21) Tj T*
(Source: Department of Financial Services, Jan Suraksha official APY FAQ and rules) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(DESCRIPTION:) Tj T*
(  Voluntary, contribution-based pension scheme focused on old-age income security,) Tj T*
(  especially for workers in the unorganized sector.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFICIARIES:) Tj T*
(  Eligible Indian citizens who join through a savings bank or post-office account and) Tj T*
(  make the required contributions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ELIGIBILITY:) Tj T*
(  ['The subscriber must be an Indian citizen aged 18 to 40 and hold a savings) Tj T*
(  bank/post-office savings account.', 'Contribution amount depends on joining age and) Tj T*
(  chosen pension; current joining exclusions must be checked in official rules.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(BENEFITS:) Tj T*
(  - A government-guaranteed minimum monthly pension of  1,000,  2,000,  3,000,  4,000) Tj T*
(or  5,000 from age 60, depending on the contribution option and scheme rules.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(HOW TO APPLY:) Tj T*
(  ['Enroll through a participating bank or post office using the APY registration) Tj T*
(  process and an eligible savings account.', 'The subscriber authorizes periodic) Tj T*
(  contributions; contribution amounts depend on age and selected pension.']) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj T*
() Tj T*
